    ci: fire CI on version tags (v*) — RELEASE-002 gate 1
    
    Adds tags:['v*'] to ci.yml on.push so a release tag gets a CI run on
    the tag commit before any Release object is created (releng NO-GO
    condition removed). Non-breaking: main/PR triggers unchanged.
    
    ch:trace row=RELEASE-002 spec=.github/workflows/ci.yml wave=gate-1 witness=none:trigger-config — verification is the next tag push firing a run; deferred until an authorized cut
    
